        "content": "<h1>Lock the Feet</h1><p><em>Iron spurs lock against the threshold.</em></p><h2>Rules</h2><p><strong>ID:</strong> monster-iron-gatekeeper-lock-the-feet</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Maneuver</p><p>Gain Stability 3 while on solid ground until its next turn; highest source only.</p><p><strong>Limits:</strong> Costs its Maneuver; no extra action is granted.</p>"
